            {
              "_key": "k142",
              "_type": "block",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_key": "k143",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Row 14, the rebate under section 156 of the Income-tax Act, 2025 (section 87A of the 1961 Act), is zero because it applies under the old regime only when taxable income is ₹5 lakh or less. Row 18, relief under section 157 (section 89), applies only if you received salary arrears. Row 19 matches the TDS in Part A exactly, which is the sign of a well-run payroll.",
                  "marks": []
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
